          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-6f4c8b1e5d@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Sep 13 2018 18:38:38 GMT-0400",
          "text": "<h2><span class=\"fontsize-8em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1em\">Stryker's Sports Medicine business is driven to advance sports medicine with you. We are a leading sports medicine company that delivers an integrated sports medicine product portfolio inclusive of the latest technology for arthroscopic and open shoulder, hip, knee and small joint procedures.</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"fontsize-8em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1em\">Our innovative sports medicine equipment includes implants, instrumentation, resection and biologic solutions to meet your needs in any repair.</span></span></h2>\n",
